# Fragmento Docker legado — COPY manual de bibliotecas compartilhadas.
# Preferir: FROM delpi-plugins-shared-builder:local (ver Dockerfile.plugin.mfe + build-plugins-shared-base.sh).

Coloque **após** `WORKDIR /app` e **antes** do `COPY` do plugin consumidor.
Contexto de build no Compose: `context: ../plugins` (não `../plugins/meu-plugin`).

```dockerfile
# --- bibliotecas compartilhadas (manifesto: plugins/shared-libraries.manifest.json) ---
COPY tv-dashboard-presentation/package*.json ./tv-dashboard-presentation/
RUN cd tv-dashboard-presentation && npm install

COPY plugin-ui/package*.json ./plugin-ui/
RUN cd plugin-ui && npm install
# --- fim bibliotecas compartilhadas ---

COPY tv-dashboard-presentation ./tv-dashboard-presentation
COPY plugin-ui ./plugin-ui

COPY meu-plugin/package*.json ./meu-plugin/
RUN cd meu-plugin && npm install

COPY meu-plugin ./meu-plugin

WORKDIR /app/meu-plugin
RUN npm run build
```

Inclua **somente** as pastas que o plugin importa (detectado pelo gate CI).

Gate:

```bash
python3 scripts/ci/check_plugin_docker_shared_libraries.py --check
```
